{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1760370516\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1760370516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1760370516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN MOTORCYCLE EMPIRE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Motorcycle For Sale Simulator Demo and bring rusty, forgotten bikes back to life. Start small, be bold, and build your dealership empire from scrap machines to luxury superbikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/e45e7356e8d48f4af72942d5d95831f1.poster.avif?t=1760370516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/e45e7356e8d48f4af72942d5d95831f1.webm?t=1760370516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY, REPAIR, MODIFY, SELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the market and grab the best deals. Overhaul every detail including engine, exhaust, tires, paint, and stickers. Restore, personalize, and prove the power of your ride with test drives. Attract customers and negotiate the most profitable deals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/a6b90fd30cf00d67b929d3604f807078.poster.avif?t=1760370516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/a6b90fd30cf00d67b929d3604f807078.webm?t=1760370516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/a6b90fd30cf00d67b929d3604f807078.mp4?t=1760370516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE CITY, SHOW OFF YOUR RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover city streets, push the throttle on the highway, and weave through traffic. Rev your engine to draw the crowd\u2019s attention, interact with special NPCs, take a passenger on the back seat, and make your name known in the motorcycle world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/e45e7356e8d48f4af72942d5d95831f1.poster.avif?t=1760370516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/extras/e45e7356e8d48f4af72942d5d95831f1.webm?t=1760370516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR GARAGE AND LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your workshop and showroom for more bikes. Buy your own house, rest, and manage your time. Keep an eye on your fuel tank\u2014an empty one will leave you stranded. No adventure without gas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A REALISTIC AND IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough negotiations, repair costs, and financial management\u2026 Every decision is critical to growing your business. Feel the traffic, pedestrians, and day\u2013night cycle in a living, breathing city atmosphere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO CONTENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your first workshop area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, repair, modify, and negotiate with a limited selection of motorcycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your bike with paint and sticker customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take short rides in the city and test your motorcycle on the road.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT WILL BE IN THE FULL VERSION?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full city map and different areas (highway, side streets, special locations).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of motorcycles (classics, choppers, superbikes).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded workshop and showroom system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own a house, rest, and manage time and fuel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story missions, special NPC interactions, and more customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day\u2013night cycle, traffic, and a lively city atmosphere.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036880?t=1760370516","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/277fa27b5ae10a2aadd47842ffb4a3ec30cf80e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760370516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/a9bdcd8eafaa14276978841d6c81cb5fd27f990e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760370516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036880/a9bdcd8eafaa14276978841d6c81cb5fd27f990e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760370516","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop